WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.806
Dog and Pig were playing catch again.

2
00:00:08.807 --> 00:00:12.500
"Can I play?" asked Cat.

3
00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:18.062
Dog looked at Pig.

4
00:00:18.063 --> 00:00:21.585
Pig looked at Dog.

5
00:00:21.586 --> 00:00:28.743
"No, Cat," said Dog.

6
00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:32.976
"No, Cat," said Pig.

7
00:00:32.977 --> 00:00:37.153
"Why not?" asked Cat.

8
00:00:37.154 --> 00:00:41.345
"You are not good at catch," said Dog.

9
00:00:41.346 --> 00:00:47.900
"You stink!" said Pig.

10
00:00:47.901 --> 00:00:54.980
"Mmpf!" said Cat.

11
00:00:54.981 --> 00:01:00.517
Cat found Bat.

12
00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:04.570
"Pig and Dog are mean," she said.

13
00:01:04.571 --> 00:01:08.518
"They said I stink at catch!"

14
00:01:08.519 --> 00:01:12.333
"That is mean," said Bat.

15
00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:15.519
"But they are right, Cat.

16
00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:20.014
You are not good at catch."

17
00:01:20.015 --> 00:01:27.117
"Mmpf!" said Cat.

18
00:01:27.118 --> 00:01:30.797
She found Cow.

19
00:01:30.798 --> 00:01:36.469
"Bat and Pig and Dog are mean," said Cat.

20
00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:40.191
"They said I stink at catch."

21
00:01:40.192 --> 00:01:43.571
"They are right, Cat," said Cow.

22
00:01:43.572 --> 00:01:47.619
"You are not good at catch."

23
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.663
"Mmpf!" said Cat.

24
00:01:51.664 --> 00:01:59.914
Cat ran into the barn.

25
00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:04.698
"I have no friends here.

26
00:02:04.699 --> 00:02:09.080
I will run away!"

